window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>After finally allowing herself to love again, Harper wakes up miles away from the men who have kept her safe—and in the hands of those determined to destroy her from the inside out.</b></p> <p>Unsure of whether or not she can rely on Ronan, Mac, and Finn to save her, Harper must find the strength to free herself. But if she does, how is she meant to face what comes next?</p> <p>With a world of unknowns hanging in the balance, Ronan, Mac, and Finn know two things for certain. They are willing to burn the world down around them to get her back, and just as they own her heart, she owns theirs.</p> <p>They just need to figure out how to keep her.</p> <p>Dangerously Kept <i>is part two of a duet. To fully understand the story, you should listen to part one,</i> Dangerously Safe, <i>first. It's a reverse harem romance intended for mature listeners. The FMC doesn't choose between love interests. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
